---
description: Global architecture rules
alwaysApply: true
---

# Architecture

- Dependency direction: SharedKernel <- Domain <- Application <- Infrastructure <- Api
- Use custom CQRS dispatcher, never MediatR
- Use Result pattern for expected failures
- Use TypedResults in minimal API endpoints
- Use IOptions<T> for configuration, never raw IConfiguration indexing
- Pipeline behavior order is fixed: Logging -> Authorization -> Validation -> Caching -> Transaction -> Performance
- Middleware order is fixed and must not be changed
- Project names have no BestPractice prefix
- IUnitOfWork contains only SaveChangesAsync
- v1 has in-process domain events only, no Outbox
